; ── Thinning composition: the ELIMINATION rules only (Orientation A) ──
; Generators: oz (empty []⊑[]), os (keep), od (drop, = o').  cmp = composition (⨾).
; Claim: CONFLUENT and TERMINATING.  (Rules are left-linear and non-overlapping —
; disjoint by the SECOND argument's head: od / os / oz — so trivially confluent.)
(VAR x y z)
(RULES
  cmp(x,od(y))     -> od(cmp(x,y))
  cmp(os(x),os(y)) -> os(cmp(x,y))
  cmp(od(x),os(y)) -> od(cmp(x,y))
  cmp(oz,oz)       -> oz
)
